# Normalise commit authorship.
#
# The very first commit of this repository was made with a placeholder GitHub
# noreply address (shimakaze@users.noreply.github.com), which GitHub attributed
# to the unrelated user "shimakaze". It was re-authored, and this .mailmap keeps
# any such address mapped onto the project owner so it cannot happen again.
#
# Format:  Proper Name <proper@email>  Commit Name <commit@email>

